test: render integrates into the CLI with semantic section selection and clean stdout
-- args.json --
["render","--format","html","--section","OPTIONS","--assets","omit-fonts","-"]
-- stdin.1 --
.TH DEMO 1
.SH NAME
outside
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v
Verbose output.
